SidekickDB
https://github.com/SidekickDB/sidekick

SidekickDB is a modified version of InstantDB
(https://github.com/instantdb/instant), which was created by Instant
(https://instantdb.com) and its contributors and is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of the license is in LICENSE.md.

SidekickDB is an independent continuation of that code. It is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Instant. "Instant" and "InstantDB" are used
here only to say where the code comes from.

Files in this repository have been changed from the original. The
intentional changes are listed in UPSTREAM.md under "Intentional
divergences", and many of them are marked with a "SidekickDB:" comment in
the file. Mechanical renames (the package scope and package names) are not
marked in the files. Every change is recorded in the git history, which
also keeps the original authors of every upstream commit.
